This repository contains simulation output data (figures, CSV files,
and summary reports) associated with the following research paper:

    K. Majumdar, "Acoustic Binary Image Transmission Using FSK and
    BPSK Modulation with RLE Compression and Hamming Error Correction:
    A Simulation Study," IEEE CIACON 2026, Durgapur, India, July 2026.

PERMITTED USES

1. You may view and download the data files in this repository for
   personal academic study and reference.

2. You may cite the above paper and reference this repository in your
   own academic publications, provided proper attribution is given.

3. You may use the numerical data (CSV files) for the sole purpose of
   verifying or comparing results published in the above paper, with
   full attribution.

RESTRICTIONS

1. Redistribution of any file in this repository, in original or
   modified form, is not permitted without the prior written consent
   of the copyright holder.

2. The simulation output data, figures, and any derived works may not
   be used for commercial purposes of any kind.

3. The data may not be incorporated into any other dataset, product,
   or publication without explicit written permission from the
   copyright holder.

4. The source code used to generate these results is not included in
   this repository and remains the exclusive intellectual property of
   the copyright holder. Reverse engineering or reconstruction of the
   source code from the provided output data is not permitted.

5. This repository may not be forked for redistribution purposes.
   Forking for private academic review is permitted provided the above
   restrictions are respected.

